# Implementation Acceptance Status

## Current Native Hero Correction

The image revision's independent browser check found a real copy-button
obstruction under hero tilt, plus phone prompt-panel occlusion of the selected
illustrations. The continuation is fixing these in the homepage only and
repeating the required gates. `resume-hero-hit-20261031.md` owns current
progress. No final acceptance is claimed from the prior 1624-test pass or the
78/82 first real-image browser run. Long-URL approval and pinned-runtime parity
remain unresolved, and no commit/deployment/archive is authorized.

## Resumed Asset Revision

The source session continued after the earlier failure report, successfully
generated all three scenes, then stopped with agent-transport HTTP 413. The
continuation has inspected and published original bookshop v1, fox v1 and rain
v2 PNGs at actual 1448x1086 dimensions. `assets/image-manifest.json` records the
selected bytes and provenance; `resume-20261031.md` records scope and baseline.
Fresh asset, independent, full automated and browser gates are in progress.
The historical no-image statements and counts below do not describe final
acceptance of this resumed revision. The long-URL decision is still pending.

